            hidden infrastructure that supports everything above the surface. Just as the mythical city was a self-contained 
            wonder, our framework will act as a "hidden layer" of digital support that operates quietly in the background, 
            ensuring that the user's environment adapts to them, rather than forcing the user to adapt to the environment.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Safety and Oversight</h2>
        <p>
            To ensure the highest ethical standards and data privacy, our project will employ a digital <span class="keyword-highlight">constable</span>. 
            This refers to an automated, high-security monitoring agent—a software watchdog—that audits all data transmissions 
            between devices. This "constable" ensures that sensitive biometric data is encrypted and that no unauthorized 
            third-party access occurs, maintaining the user's autonomy and privacy.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Expected Outcomes</h2>
        <p>
            The primary outcome will be a prototype "Adaptive Living Suite" capable of reducing the cognitive load 
            and physical fatigue associated with navigating non-accessible environments. Success will be measured 
